            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-tag">Field geology · Tectonometamorphic evolution</div>
              <h3>Santa María de la Alameda: Geological Mapping and Tectonometamorphic Evolution</h3>
              <p>A geological field study of the southern Robledondo sector of the Santa María de la Alameda gneissic dome, combining detailed mapping, macroscopic petrographic observations and structural measurements.</p>
              <p>The report characterises orthogneisses, leucogneisses, migmatitic levels and mylonitic bands, using foliations, mineral lineations, folds and ductile shear zones to interpret Variscan regional metamorphism, deformation and tectonic exhumation.</p>
