            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-tag">Hydrology · Basin analysis</div>
              <h3>Hydrological Study of the Peñarroya Reservoir Basin</h3>
              <p>A hydrological assessment of the Peñarroya reservoir basin and the Ruidera Lakes area in Campo de Montiel, focused on how precipitation, evapotranspiration, runoff and groundwater contribute to the basin water balance.</p>
              <p>The study combines manual and QGIS-based watershed delineation with arithmetic means, Thiessen–Voronoi polygons, isohyet methods, Thornthwaite potential evapotranspiration, rating curves and hydrograph separation to evaluate water availability and environmental pressures.</p>
